ents` with int(...); no validation or exception translation is present.,Malformed client input can raise raw KeyError or ValueError and leak framework-dependent 500 responses.,Validate request shape before constructing Order and convert invalid input into stable client error responses.,API maintainer\r\nR5,HTTP integration contract,minisvc.api.routes:register_routes assumes `app.post` and `app.get` methods and uses lambdas without explicit adapter typing or tests.,Adapter mismatches will fail at runtime and can be hard to diagnose for new integrations.,\"Document or codify the app interface expected by register_routes, and add a small integration test with the intended framework.\",API/integration owner\r\n","startLine":1,"lineNumbers":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7]},"fileSize":2193,"meta":{"source":{"type":"path","value":"/workspace/out/risk_register.csv"}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788182483806}}
